DESCRIPTION:International Conference on Algorithmic Learning Theory\nStatus
 : confirmed\, checked 2026-10-31\nOfficial source: https://algorithmiclea
 rningtheory.org/alt2027/\nVenue Radar: https://gon-uri.github.io/venue-ra
 dar/#alt-2027\nNotes: Official ALT 2027 pages confirm the 38th ALT on Mar
 ch 9-12\, 2027 at Scheltema Leiden\, in person with no remote talks (an a
 uthor must present). Papers were due October 12\, 2026\, 11:59 p.m. AoE o
 n OpenReview\; no other fresh-submission route is listed\, so the edition
  is closed. Accepted papers appear in PMLR\, or authors may opt for a one
 -page extended abstract pointing to an archival full version. Feedback an
 d notification days have no stated hour. Size basis is 69 papers in PMLR 
 v313 (ALT 2026) and 51 of 144 accepted at ALT 2025. Size is an editorial 
 estimate.
CATEGORIES:Learning Theory & Statistical Foundations,Machine Learning
URL:https://algorithmiclearningtheory.org/alt2027/
